@section rest_thumbnails Thumbnails

@subsection rest_thumb_post POST /api/thumbnails

Uploads a new thumbnail.  Request body: raw PNG bytes
(`Content-Type: image/png`).  Response: `{"id":N}`.

@subsection rest_thumb_get GET /api/thumbnails/{id}

