@section rest_reservation_json Reservation JSON Schema

| Field        | Type   | Required | Description                         |
|--------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------|
| `id`         | int    | no       | Reservation ID (0 for new)          |
| `item_id`    | int    | yes      | Item ID                             |
| `person_id`  | int    | yes      | Person ID (forced to own for non-admin callers) |
